Send tool-list changes only to authorized affected clients where supported by the actual SDK/protocol; preserve stable search helper contracts when possible. Handle notifications outside request scope safely and explain manual client refresh when needed. Acceptance: server generation changes independently of client cache; no cross-user metadata/notification leak; documented client-specific refresh evidence. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
